      "uid": "zhcn:41475621a46e886baa1b149e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "富士奇石的表现迷倒了众人。\n她在赛后的记者会上，\n宣告要以“三冠赛马娘”为目标。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f58ee7df1eda4f131ba42144fba6f45db8058e24ff3c625975595ac813ae19e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
