    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5aa6e60dd2b33da92f9cbe9e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了万全地迎接“皋月赏”，富士奇石想\n先经历一次大舞台。为了回应她的心意，\n训练员将竞赛目标设定为“弥生赏”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e06140a7736650334377913b36598db2591929bd904e5996ed882147325c4715",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1005/storytimeline_501005421.json",
      "json_path": [
