    {
      "uid": "zhcn:69ec7f0be6a9ec9372422160",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "富士奇石在“弥生赏”也同样迷倒了观众。\n周遭越来越期待她达成经典三冠。",
      "source_fingerprint": "68dfd8dd5f23bf0940a8fbe0fa2868044c88febed552d3052c7bc3b744a5b643",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1005/storytimeline_501005422.json",
      "json_path": [
