      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了回应这些期待，她不断努力练习。\n训练员被她这副模样打动，\n于是策划了惊喜要来慰劳她。",
      "source_fingerprint": "89c08871fd9a921bb2545ed75b40e4546c7ba2841e5bc722706fbb8c829a790a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
