    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e88a3ac93b7f22632df1e9d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员表演了把星星变成星形胸针的\n魔术，想把“天上最耀眼的星星”送给\n富士奇石，不料却失败了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d60a85319b893fe481e2ecfe6e57ad80f9d28dc2ea31dd2ddefde5f0f1b57c9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
