    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c436429a0bb1ba8e09655c13",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她对自己的距离资质心怀疑问。\n这时，她决定寻求爱丽速子的协助，\n两个人一起验证这件事。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b84a86e15e7e5077863dc1e4bf0b6e5bedac3a850f0c88839af6c0a3c1e50740",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
